    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Orgs where every DecisionTable has Status = Draft (none Active).
Why it matters: ARM pricing relies on decision tables; if all are Draft, no pricing branches engage and quotes fall to defaults. Critical operational gap.
Suppress a finding: never — activate at least one if ARM pricing is meant to work.
Disable the detector: only if decision tables aren&apos;t part of your ARM setup.</value></values>
